== presentable (§7.1)
"notes.txt"                  shown
"a:b"                        a character Windows refuses in a name
"a?"                         a character Windows refuses in a name
"pipe|"                      a character Windows refuses in a name
"tab\there"                  a character Windows refuses in a name
"trailing."                  a name ending with a space or a dot
"trailing "                  a name ending with a space or a dot
"CON"                        a reserved device name
"con.txt"                    a reserved device name
"Com1.log"                   a reserved device name
"COM\194\185"                a reserved device name
"LPT0"                       a reserved device name
"CONSOLE"                    shown
"conx.txt"                   shown
".hidden"                    shown
"caf\195\169"                shown
"bad\255byte"                shown as "bad\239\191\189byte"
<255 bytes>                  shown
<256 bytes>                  longer than 255 UTF-16 code units
<508 bytes>                  shown
<512 bytes>                  longer than 255 UTF-16 code units

== case groups (§7.2)
none on disk: the least by bytes
  shown: README, other
  not shown: readme, the group shows README
  not shown: Readme, the group shows README
the one on disk stays
  shown: readme
  not shown: README, the group shows readme
  not shown: Readme, the group shows readme
unpresentable and grouped together
  shown: X, a
  not shown: a., a name ending with a space or a dot
  not shown: x, the group shows X

