== apply state (§10.1)
{"anchor":"12|3","pending":["d:9f3a","root"]} -> reads back
fresh: anchor "", pending [root]
""                                       unreadable
"{}"                                     unreadable
"{\"anchor\":\"x\"}"                     unreadable
"{\"anchor\":\"x\",\"pending\":[1]}"     unreadable
"not json"                               unreadable

== applying a folder (§10.2)
a new folder: everything is created
  create a.txt (file)
  create sub (folder)
in step: nothing
  nothing
a peer renamed it
  rename a.txt -> b.txt
a peer edited it
  refresh a.txt
a peer renamed and edited it
  rename a.txt -> b.txt
  refresh b.txt
only its time changed
  update a.txt
a row with no time is not compared on it
  nothing
an owed child is taken, and a row of its name not created
  take notes.txt
an owed edit is taken, never refreshed
  take a.txt
a peer deleted it
  delete gone.txt
a peer moved it to a folder the root holds
  move gone.txt into C:\root\sub as gone.txt
a foreign item stays, and its name is not reused
  nothing
names Windows refuses, links and case groups are not created
  create X (file)
the group member on disk stays
  nothing
